00:35:14.996 --> 00:35:16.865
but it could lead to engagement.

00:35:16.865 --> 00:35:18.366
It could.

00:35:18.366 --> 00:35:21.236
And now, some people
when they get engaged,

00:35:21.236 --> 00:35:24.773
one person buys
