00:35:48.396 --> 00:35:52.267
because graphite is the
lowest most energetically

00:35:52.267 --> 00:35:54.536
stable form of carbon.

00:35:54.536 --> 00:35:56.371
So I'm just, again,
always trying to help.

00:35:56.371 --> 00:36:01.910
But this is the most
stable form of carbon.

00:36:01.910 --> 00:36:05.313
And it's a bunch of
benzene, but repeated.

00:36:05.313 --> 00:36:06.815
Not benzene, the
hydrogens are gone.

00:36:06.815 --> 00:36:09.017
It's just pure
graphene, but repeated

00:36:09.017 --> 00:36:12.454
in these beautiful rings.

00:36:12.454 --> 00:36:16.691
And when we come
